{"version":1,"content":"<p>西班牙首都馬德里周日（25日）舉行「遊牧節」（Transhumance Festival），大批綿羊與山羊湧入市中心街頭，場面壯觀，吸引了大批遊客和當地居民觀賞。</p><p>節慶源自牲畜轉場傳統，牧羊人冬季會把牛羊從山區趕往溫暖草原，確保牲畜有足夠糧草。</p><p>（新華社）</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-26T05:40:42.185930+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":128,"images":0,"source":"明報 消閒","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-26T05:03:37+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-26T22:18:08.131053+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-26T05:38:01.173619+00:00","content_hash":"9618443e71d2c67538207f60cfa03185862c499e7984d3fd7f57e46a5eb0f5e0","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}